# The Makefile's artifact directory, at the repo root only. Unanchored, this
# also matched `chains/rust/*/src/bin/` — which is Rust SOURCE, and where the
# chain differential's Rust evaluators live. A build rule that silently
# dropped one of the differential's voices is the failure the differential
# exists to prevent.
/bin/
build/
/luxd
*.o
*.a

# LLM.md is the canonical, tracked document. The three aliases are local
# conveniences for whichever assistant is reading — symlinks to LLM.md, so they
# carry no content of their own and tracking them would only be a way for the
# repository to hold the same file under four names.
#   ln -sf LLM.md AGENTS.md && ln -sf LLM.md GEMINI.md && ln -sf LLM.md CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
CLAUDE.md

# Rust build output.
target/

# The chain differential's Go evaluator, built by `make chains`.
/conformance/gen/gen
/conformance/precompile/precompile
bin/.go/
